{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226620","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226620","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"narration:2:1222662001:0":{"text":"A few hours later, Vayne returns to report to Lucca.","source_cn":"数小时后，瓦因匆匆归来，向卢卡汇报——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEAC003D873D7E17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1222662002:0":{"text":"So, I followed the lady, and there's a lot to say. But I'll be quick.","source_cn":"跟踪纳莉安的这一路有了大收获！各位，我长话短说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2833833EA4D52451","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222662003:0":{"text":"After she left you guys, she didn't go home. She just wandered around and talked to some sketchy people.","source_cn":"我们放走她后，她没有回家，又去到处瞎转悠，接触那些贩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66873FD744993494","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1222662004:0":{"text":"Huh? So she really is up to no good!","source_cn":"哎？所以她真的是坏人啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49EE9213860625ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222662005:0":{"text":"Wait, I'm not done yet!","source_cn":"别心急啊，听我说完。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A69554DE4BD7DAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222662006:0":{"text":"At first, nobody wanted to sell her a boat, but then Gunnar told Grayfang about her, and I saw Grayfang himself go up to her with a deal.","source_cn":"一开始没人卖她船，但等红锚传了消息，我看灰舌亲自去找她...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0A3665A93749814","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222662007:0":{"text":"After they made the deal, she tried to walk all around the city to lose anyone following her. But she couldn't lose me!","source_cn":"等交易定下来，她故意在城里兜了几圈，像是要甩掉跟踪者—...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01973398CE9AB33C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222662008:1":{"text":"Then, she headed to Brineville!","source_cn":"接着，她去了小水村！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E103770EE22DE4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222662009:0":{"text":"Brineville? That's Sinbad's home. What's she doing there?","source_cn":"小水村！那是辛巴达的家，她去那里干什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BEBC9D130E5941F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222662010:0":{"text":"She went into an old, spooky house. When I peeked through the window, I saw a Graveborn hiding inside!","source_cn":"她进了一间没人住的破屋子，我趴在窗口，看见那屋子里竟然...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FFC04059E1AE3DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222662011:0":{"text":"It was the exact same one from the wanted posters.","source_cn":"那亡灵跟通缉令上长得一模一样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21DA967B0DF37F2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222662012:0":{"text":"I also heard bits of their talk...","source_cn":"然后，我听到了她们的对话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BE6BA63314D8CC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1222662013:0":{"text":"The ship's ready. It can get you out of Rustport, though it might not reach your final destination.","source_cn":"已经找到船了，他们可以送您离开锈锚港，但恐怕没法直接抵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2932B2A25C768C0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1222662014:0":{"text":"That's fine. I wasn't planning on heading straight back.","source_cn":"可以，我也没打算直接回去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D5A399642389151","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1222662015:0":{"text":"We'll need to head to the dock tonight under the cover of the clouds. And don't worry, if anything goes wrong, I'll take the blame!","source_cn":"那今晚得去小水湾的渡口，我陪着您。到时您直接上船，万一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B183F53E015D00E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1222662016:1":{"text":"... You don't need to go that far.","source_cn":"……你没必要承担这些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68675305925F0178","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1222662017:1":{"text":"I'm an enemy of the Carmine Whispers, and a Graveborn at that. You're just an ordinary person...","source_cn":"我是血薇帮的敌人，还是亡灵。而你只是个普通人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07466626800CCC88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1222662018:1":{"text":"Please, don't say that!","source_cn":"您千万别这么说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC55869D1BD1E638","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1222662019:1":{"text":"If it weren't for you, my gambling brother would've killed me for money long ago!","source_cn":"如果不是您救了我，我弟弟那个赌鬼早为了钱，把我弄死了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEB233776EBA4BB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1222662020:1":{"text":"Compared to that, this bit of effort is nothing!","source_cn":"我为您做的这点小事，根本不足以报答您的救命之恩！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38B92808BDCDA97E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1222662021:1":{"text":"Nalianne... thank you.","source_cn":"……纳莉安……谢谢你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3E8AC3B087E7864","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1222662022:0":{"text":"You don't need to thank me... It's just that the thought of leaving you... I'm suddenly getting quite sad.","source_cn":"您无需感谢……只是，我想到要离开您，真的有些舍不得……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD40E7CBBBB72CBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1222662023:1":{"text":"...!\nWho's there?!","source_cn":"……！\\n谁在外面！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57DEFD05F88310EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1222662024:1":{"text":"I accidentally bumped into the wall and made the tiniest bit of noise, and she instantly got suspicious.","source_cn":"——事情的经过就是这样。我只是不小心擦了下墙边，她立刻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF068D8E8B20DB0A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1222662025:1":{"text":"Luckily, a rat scurried by, so I escaped her notice!","source_cn":"我从没见过那么敏锐的人……幸好当时有只老鼠贴着墙根溜过...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F57CBCE8D389D15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1222662026:1":{"text":"And that's all, boss!","source_cn":"二当家，就这些了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25E12E671BB3FBC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1222662027:1":{"text":"Excellent work, kiddo! You've provided us with crucial intel.","source_cn":"辛苦了！你做得非常好，这可是重大情报！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6EAA710772CD5E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1222662028:1":{"text":"Since they're on the move tonight, we need to find Sonja and make a plan.","source_cn":"既然她们今晚就要行动，我们现在就去找索尼娅商量对策。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD580CFF85DD2A6AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"Subtitles","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:探子瓦因":{"text":"Vayne","source":"探子瓦因","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:纳莉安":{"text":"Nalianne","source":"纳莉安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:冷漠的亡灵少女":{"text":"Graveborn Girl","source":"冷漠的亡灵少女","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢卡":{"text":"Lucca","source":"卢卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":29,"localized_text_count":28,"speaker_count":6}}